    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To synthesize SSML with voice and prosody controls, I will use Amazon Polly, a text-to-speech service that turns text into lifelike speech. I will import the boto3 library to interact with Amazon Polly and use the 'polly' client to synthesize the SSML. The provider will be identifiable by the import of boto3 and the use of the 'polly' client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789862292745,
          "start": 1789862290316
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc1b238c001kH10ToXFKSd659",
